Feature: XFail package smoke

  # Step-level hashtags are XFail's documented primary surface, and they only work when
  # Ohirok.StepHashtags.ReqnrollPlugin's generator plugin runs. That plugin arrives here purely as a
  # transitive NuGet dependency, so these scenarios fail outright if its build props stop flowing.

  Scenario: Expected failure is caught and the scenario continues
    Given the system is ready
    #xfail:InvalidOperationException
    When the known-bug step runs
    Then the xfail hook observed a failure

  Scenario: Allowed failure is tolerated
    Given the system is ready
    #afail:TimeoutException
    When the flaky step times out
    Then the scenario reached its final step

  # A scenario tag is generated by Ohirok.XFail.ReqnrollPlugin's own generator plugin, so this scenario fails
  # outright if that plugin does not activate from the package alone.
  @xfail:InvalidOperationException
  Scenario: Expected failure tagged on the scenario passes the test
    Given the system is ready
    When the known-bug step runs
